Template Type:{!$Apex:GetAtRiskRenewalOpportunities.emailTemplateType}
Instructions: for each Opportunity, generate a personalized outreach email draft using a Prompt Builder template that reads account health signals such as Opportunity Stage, Contract End Date, Last Activity Date, CSAT Score (customer satisfaction ), and number of open Cases. The tone of the email should automatically adjust 

Contract End Date is between 31–60 days, use nurturing tone.
Keep professional and concise.

